,"kind":"sign","params":{"at":[-13.8,0.12,-2.6],"rotY":-0.2,"scale":1}}],"cues":[],"audio":{"cards":[{"text":"3 FEET","at":{"s":"fix1","w":"three"},"d":1.5},{"text":"400 PARTS","at":{"s":"stakes","w":"400"},"d":1.8},{"text":"230 °DEGREES","at":{"s":"fact","w":"230"},"d":1.6}],"sfx":[{"lib":"flame","at":{"s":"hook","w":"fire"},"d":1.2},{"lib":"flame","at":{"s":"problem2","w":"roars"},"d":1.4},{"lib":"flame","at":{"s":"how","w":"fire"},"d":1.2}],"chimes":[{"s":"fix1","w":"three"},{"s":"stakes","w":"400"},{"s":"name"},{"s":"fact","w":"230"},{"s":"congrats"}]},"codeShots":true,"why":"A cookstove explained in a room cutaway: a pan on an open fire fills the room with smoke, and each fix (an iron firebox with a flue, a damper, an oven) causes the next problem. The camera opens close on the fire, then frames the stove with the gauge beside it, and shows the flue and the room only when the smoke and heat travel there. The finish adds the kettle, the stew pot and a chimney cap to the stove itself.","hold":true,"beats":[{"s":"hook","shows":{"p":"fire","does":"flames lick the pan"},"do":[{"p":"openFire","v":"show"},{"p":"fire","v":"show","w":"fire"}],"shots":[{"focus":["openFire","fire"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"problem","shows":{"p":"smoke","does":"smoke rises to the ceiling"},"state":{"text":"SMOKY","w":"smoke"},"do":[{"p":"smoke","v":"start","w":"smoke"}],"shots":[{"focus":["openFire","smoke","fire"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"flood","shows":{"p":"smokeBank","does":"smoke banks down the walls"},"do":[{"p":"smokeBank","v":"start","w":"floods"}],"shots":[{"focus":"home","type":"wide"}]},{"s":"stakes","shows":{"p":"coGauge","does":"gauge climbs to 400"},"state":{"text":"TOXIC AIR","w":"carbon"},"do":[{"p":"coGauge","v":"show","w":"carbon"},{"p":"coGauge","v":"count","w":"monoxide","d":2.4}],"shots":[{"focus":["openFire","coGauge","fire"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"fix1","shows":{"p":"flue","does":"pipe grows up through the roof"},"do":[{"p":"coGauge","v":"hide","w":"box"},{"p":"stove","v":"show","w":"box"},{"p":"openFire","v":"hide","w":"box"},{"p":"stove","v":"panOn","w":"box"},{"p":"stove","v":"pipeOn","w":"pipe"},{"p":"flue","v":"grow","w":"pipe","d":1.6},{"p":"smoke","v":"stop","w":"pipe","o":0.3},{"p":"smokeBank","v":"stop","w":"pipe","o":0.3},{"p":"flueFlow","v":"show","w":"pipe","o":1.4}],"shots":[{"focus":["stove","flue","fire"],"width":0.94},{"at":{"s":"fix1","w":"pipe"},"focus":["flue","fire"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"problem2","shows":{"p":"heatGauge","does":"gauge races into the red"},"state":{"text":"TOO HOT","w":"roars"},"do":[{"p":"heatUp","v":"show","w":"pipe"},{"p":"heatGauge","v":"show","w":"roars"},{"p":"heatGauge","v":"count","w":"roars","d":2.2}],"shots":[{"focus":["stove","heatGauge","fire"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"fix2","shows":{"p":"stove","does":"damper lever swings and the gauge falls"},"do":[{"p":"heatGauge","v":"hide","w":"So"},{"p":"heatUp","v":"hide","w":"damper"},{"p":"steadyGauge","v":"show","w":"damper"},{"p":"steadyGauge","v":"count","w":"damper","d":2},{"p":"stove","v":"damperClose","w":"damper"}],"shots":[{"focus":["stove","steadyGauge","fire"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"problem3","shows":{"p":"heatUp","does":"heat arrows race up the pipe and out"},"state":{"text":"HEAT LOST","w":"heat"},"do":[{"p":"steadyGauge","v":"hide","w":"But"},{"p":"heatUp","v":"show","w":"races"}],"shots":[{"focus":["stove","flue","heatUp","fire"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"fix3","shows":{"p":"stove","does":"oven pops in beside the fire, hot gas loops round it"},"do":[{"p":"heatUp","v":"hide","w":"So"},{"p":"stove","v":"ovenOn","w":"oven"},{"p":"stove","v":"ovenGlow","w":"oven","o":0.7},{"p":"ovenHeat","v":"show","w":"gas"}],"shots":[{"focus":["stove","fire"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"name","shows":{"p":"outlineStove","does":"glowing outline round the stove"},"do":[{"p":"ovenHeat","v":"hide","w":"This"},{"p":"outlineStove","v":"show","w":"cookstove"}],"shots":[{"hero":true,"focus":["stove","outlineStove","fire"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"name2","shows":{"p":"outlinePipe","does":"glowing outline round the pipe"},"do":[{"p":"outlineStove","v":"hide","w":"And"},{"p":"outlinePipe","v":"show","w":"flue"}],"shots":[{"focus":["flue","outlinePipe","fire"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"how","shows":{"p":"ovenHeat","does":"air arrows in, hot gas loops round the oven and up the flue"},"do":[{"p":"outlinePipe","v":"hide","w":"Air"},{"p":"airIn","v":"show","w":"Air"},{"p":"ovenHeat","v":"show","w":"gas"}],"shots":[{"focus":["stove","ovenHeat","fire"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"fact","shows":{"p":"ovenGauge","does":"oven gauge counts up to 230 beside a baking loaf"},"do":[{"p":"airIn","v":"hide","w":"A"},{"p":"ovenHeat","v":"hide","w":"A"},{"p":"ovenGauge","v":"show","w":"oven"},{"p":"ovenGauge","v":"count","w":"bakes","d":2.3},{"p":"stove","v":"loafOn","w":"bread"}],"shots":[{"focus":["stove","ovenGauge","fire"],"width":0.94}]},{"s":"finish","shows":{"p":"stove","does":"kettle and stew pot pop onto the plate, cap on the chimney"},"do":[{"p":"bookCook","v":"show"},{"p":"bookCook","v":"hide","w":"Add"},{"p":"stove","v":"kettleOn","w":"kettle"},{"p":"stove","v":"potOn","w":"pot"},{"p":"chimneyCap","v":"show","w":"cap","o":-0.7}],"shots":[{"focus":["fire","chimneyCap"],"width":0.85}]},{"s":"congrats","do":[],"shots":[{"focus":"home"}]}],"roles":["hook","problem","flood","stakes","fix1","problem2","fix2","problem3","fix3","name","name2","how","fact","finish","congrats"]},"sentences":[{"role":"hook","text":"If you cook a pan over an open fire, you have the simplest stove there is."},{"role":"problem","text":"But the smoke has nowhere to go, so it rises and spreads across the ceiling."},{"role":"flood","text":"Then it banks down the walls until it floods the whole room."},{"role":"stakes","text":"The air turns toxic, because carbon monoxide passes 400 parts per million, enough for a headache within 1 to 2 hours."},{"role":"fix1","text":"So you box the fire in iron and run a pipe three feet above the roof, and the smoke leaves."},{"role":"problem2","text":"But now the pipe pulls air in so hard that the fire roars and the gauge races into the red."},{"role":"fix2","text":"So you turn a damper, a flap in the pipe, to slow the air, and the gauge falls."},{"role":"problem3","text":"But now the heat races up the pipe and out of the roof, as arrows streak straight outside."},{"role":"fix3","text":"So you put an oven beside the fire, and the hot gas loops around it before it leaves."},{"role":"name","text":"This is a cookstove."},{"role":"name2","text":"And the pipe on top is called a flue."},{"role":"how","text":"Air comes in at the front and feeds the fire, and the hot gas loops around the oven and up the flue."},{"role":"fact","text":"A hot oven bakes bread at around 230 degrees Celsius, though it has no thermostat."},{"role":"finish","text":"Add a kettle, a pot of stew and a cap on the chimney."},{"role":"congrats","text":"Congratulations, you have built a cookstove."}]}